A||||7||Cheever3000||FOLD vs. Fiero USA Roster||||2||
Z||000000||Cheever3000||12-11-2001||08:31 PM||||Some of us in the new international club have tried using the FOLD database contact information to get the word out.  We are finding that it is totally useless!  In my two years as a Fiero owner, I have successfully contacted maybe a half-dozen people by using FOLD info.  A great deal of the emails are returned as being "unable to send", and many people reply saying they no longer have a Fiero.<P>I have tried valiantly in the past to remind PFF members to keep their FOLD entries updated, and I have often posted links to it for helping people get answers for owner location questions.  Apparently, however, FOLD is a FLOP.  May I suggest the next best thing?  That would be the Fiero USA Roster... <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com/List/List1.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cwestco.com/List/List1.html</A> <P>It's still a small list, but it's a start.  If anyone knows of a better database, please speak up.  If you know of any reason we shouldn't use it, again speak up.  Do you have a similar opinion of FOLD?  Shall we start flooding the Roster submit page with entries?  Give your opinion here.  Somebody recently posted the possibility of a VIN # database for ALL years of Fieros, not just 88's.  Maybe this should all be combined.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CheeverXmasSig.jpg">   <BR><I>Merry Christmas from the </I><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank><I>CFOG-I</I></A> <I>vice-president.</I>||||reg||2
Z||000001||FieroMontreal||12-11-2001||08:43 PM||||heh.. good idea.. I've tried to contact people useing fold but most of the e-mails don't work anymore.. <BR>I'd fill in a form..if only Canada was there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR> -Alex <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigfieromontrealholidays.gif"> <BR>1986 Fiero GT, STOCK Wingless, <BR>President of FieroMontreal... <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> <BR>and Regional Director of CFOG-I for Eastern Canada.||||reg||1
Z||000002||72vinman||12-11-2001||09:23 PM||||Hey Alex, try this. It is the Canadian version of Fold. <A HREF="http://fierodrivers.com/cfol/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fierodrivers.com/cfol/index.html</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cheever3000||12-11-2001||09:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>I'd fill in a form..if only Canada was there  [/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>On that first screen, don't click on the state or country.  That's just for looking at who's there.  To get on the list, click "Submit your Fiero" and fill in the form.  There is a field for country.  It will be added to the screen later.  I don't know how much later, maybe the guys at WCF can answer that.<P>||||reg||1
